      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countKeyChanges(s):\n    if len(s) <= 1:\n        return 0\n    \n    changes = 0\n    prev_key = s[0].lower()\n    \n    for i in range(1, len(s)):\n        current_key = s[i].lower()\n        if current_key != prev_key:\n            changes += 1\n        prev_key = current_key\n    \n    return changes\n```",
