      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    N, K = map(int, input().split())\n    A = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    \n    starts = 0\n    empty_seats = K\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        # If current group can't fit, start the attraction first\n        if A[i] > empty_seats:\n            starts += 1\n            empty_seats = K  # Reset after starting attraction\n        \n        # Now there are enough seats, guide this group\n        empty_seats -= A[i]\n    \n    # If there are still people in the attraction (empty_seats < K), need one more start\n    if empty_seats < K:\n        starts += 1\n    \n    print(starts)\n\nsolve()\n```",
