      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumDistance(points):\n    def manhattan_distance(p1, p2):\n        return abs(p1[0] - p2[0]) + abs(p1[1] - p2[1])\n    \n    def get_max_distance_without_index(points, exclude_idx):\n        max_dist = 0\n        for i in range(len(points)):\n            if i == exclude_idx:\n                continue\n            for j in range(i + 1, len(points)):\n                if j == exclude_idx:\n                    continue\n                max_dist = max(max_dist, manhattan_distance(points[i], points[j]))\n        return max_dist\n    \n    min_max_distance = float('inf')\n    \n    for i in range(len(points)):\n        max_distance = get_max_distance_without_index(points, i)\n        min_max_distance = min(min_max_distance, max_distance)\n    \n    return min_max_distance\n```",
