      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read all input from standard input\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    \n    if not input_data:\n        return\n\n    iterator = iter(input_data)\n    \n    try:\n        # First token is N\n        N = int(next(iterator))\n    except StopIteration:\n        return\n\n    names = []\n    total_rating = 0\n    \n    # Iterate N times to read each user's name and rating\n    for _ in range(N):\n        try:\n            name = next(iterator)\n            rating = int(next(iterator))\n            names.append(name)\n            total_rating += rating\n        except StopIteration:\n            break\n            \n    # Sort names in lexicographical order\n    names.sort()\n    \n    # The winner is the user at index (sum of ratings) % N\n    winner_index = total_rating % N\n    \n    # Print the winner's name\n    print(names[winner_index])\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
