    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distribute_candies(n, limit):\n    def count_ways(idx, remaining_candies, distributed):\n        if idx == 3:\n            return 1 if remaining_candies == 0 else 0\n        \n        ways = 0\n        for i in range(min(limit, remaining_candies) + 1):\n            distributed[idx] = i\n            ways += count_ways(idx + 1, remaining_candies - i, distributed)\n            distributed[idx] = 0\n        \n        return ways\n\n    return count_ways(0, n, [0] * 3)\n```",
