      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef shortestSubstrings(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    answer = [\"\"] * n\n    \n    # For each string in the array\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_string = arr[i]\n        other_strings = arr[:i] + arr[i+1:]  # All strings except arr[i]\n        \n        # Get all possible substrings of current_string, sorted by length and then lexicographically\n        substrings = []\n        for length in range(1, len(current_string) + 1):\n            for start in range(len(current_string) - length + 1):\n                substrings.append(current_string[start:start + length])\n        \n        # Sort by length first, then lexicographically\n        substrings.sort(key=lambda x: (len(x), x))\n        \n        # Find the first substring that doesn't appear in any other string\n        for substr in substrings:\n            found_in_others = False\n            for other in other_strings:\n                if substr in other:\n                    found_in_others = True\n                    break\n            \n            if not found_in_others:\n                answer[i] = substr\n                break\n    \n    return answer\n```",
