      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sumOfSquares(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            total += nums[i - 1] * nums[i - 1]\n    return total\n```",
