      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef incremovableSubarrays(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    result = 0\n    \n    # Check all possible subarrays\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Create array after removing subarray from i to j\n            remaining = nums[:i] + nums[j+1:]\n            \n            # Check if remaining array is strictly increasing\n            is_strictly_increasing = True\n            for k in range(1, len(remaining)):\n                if remaining[k] <= remaining[k-1]:\n                    is_strictly_increasing = False\n                    break\n            \n            if is_strictly_increasing:\n                result += 1\n    \n    return result\n```",
