    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef findPermutationDifference(s, t):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate the permutation difference between two strings s and t.\n    \n    Args:\n        s (str): First string\n        t (str): Second string (permutation of s)\n    \n    Returns:\n        int: The sum of absolute differences between indices of each character in s and t\n    \"\"\"\n    permutation_diff = 0\n    \n    # Create a dictionary to store the index of each character in t\n    t_index_map = {}\n    for i, char in enumerate(t):\n        t_index_map[char] = i\n    \n    # Calculate the sum of absolute differences\n    for i, char in enumerate(s):\n        permutation_diff += abs(i - t_index_map[char])\n    \n    return permutation_diff\n```",
