      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef return_sorted_occupied_positions(nums: List[int], moveFrom: List[int], moveTo: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    # Track occupied positions using a set for uniqueness and efficiency\n    occupied = set(nums)\n    \n    # Process each move from moveFrom to moveTo in order\n    for source, destination in zip(moveFrom, moveTo):\n        occupied.discard(source)\n        occupied.add(destination)\n    \n    # Return the sorted list of occupied positions\n    return sorted(occupied)\n```",
