    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    \n    # Read all input from stdin\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    \n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    # Parse N, P, Q\n    n = int(input_data[0])\n    p = int(input_data[1])\n    q = int(input_data[2])\n    \n    # Parse dish prices\n    dishes = [int(x) for x in input_data[3:3+n]]\n    \n    # Find the minimum dish price\n    min_dish = min(dishes)\n    \n    # Calculate the minimum cost\n    # Option 1: Pay regular price P\n    # Option 2: Pay Q + cheapest dish\n    ans = min(p, q + min_dish)\n    \n    # Print the result\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
