is an Element node. Neighbors are Sets.\n            element_val = u - N + 1\n            for s_idx in sets_containing_element[element_val]:\n                if dist[s_idx] == -1:\n                    dist[s_idx] = d_u + 1\n                    q.append(s_idx)\n                    # Check if this set is a target (contains M)\n                    if s_idx in set_target_indices:\n                        print(dist[s_idx] // 2)\n                        return\n                        \n    # If queue is empty and target not reached\n    print(-1)\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    solve()\n```",
