      "generated_answer": "The action of writing on the store wall is vandalism, regardless of frustration, and is morally unacceptable. While the salesperson may have been dismissive, damaging property to prove a point is inappropriate and disproportionate. The correct answer is that the person was in the wrong.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
