    "global index": "MMLUPro_business_591",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the date of maturity of a note dated January 30with aterm of one month?\n\nOptions: \nA. January 30\nB. March 1\nC. March 30\nD. February 25\nE. January 31\nF. March 2\nG. February 1\nH. February 30\nI. February 27\nJ. February 29 or February 28\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
