      "generated_answer": "The Sortino ratio is calculated as (Annualized Return - Risk-Free Rate) / Downside Deviation. For Fund A: (15% - 2.5%) / 8% = 12.5% / 8% = 1.5625. This rounds to approximately 1.56.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
