    "prompt": "Please solve the following mathematical problem step by step. \n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Among the 900 residents of Aimeville, there are 195 who own a diamond ring, 367 who own a set of golf clubs, and 562 who own a garden spade. In addition, each of the 900 residents owns a bag of candy hearts. There are 437 residents who own exactly two of these things, and 234 residents who own exactly three of these things. Find the number of residents of Aimeville who own all four of these things.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format, where the content inside the braces is the exact mathematical expression or number. For example: \\boxed{{42}}. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Let the total number of residents be $900$. Define the sets:  \n- $D$: diamond ring, $|D| = 195$  \n- $G$: golf clubs, $|G| = 367$  \n- $S$: garden spade, $|S| = 562$  \n- $C$: candy hearts, $|C| = 900$ (all own this).\n\nLet $x$ be the number who own all four items.  \nWe use the principle of inclusion-exclusion for four sets, but instead use the given counts of people owning exactly 2 and exactly 3 items.\n\nLet:\n- $a_1$: number who own exactly 1 item,\n- $a_2 = 437$: exactly 2 items,\n- $a_3 = 234$: exactly 3 items,\n- $a_4 = x$: exactly 4 items.\n\nThen total residents:\n$$\na_1 + a_2 + a_3 + a_4 = 900 \\Rightarrow a_1 + 437 + 234 + x = 900 \\Rightarrow a_1 = 229 - x.\n$$\n\nNow, compute the sum of ownerships:\n- Total ownerships = $195 + 367 + 562 + 900 = 2024$.\n\nThis counts:\n- 1 time for each person with exactly 1 item: $1 \\cdot a_1$,\n- 2 times for each with exactly 2 items: $2 \\cdot 437 = 874$,\n- 3 times for exactly 3 items: $3 \\cdot 234 = 702$,\n- 4 times for all 4 items: $4x$.\n\nSo:\n$$\n1 \\cdot a_1 + 2 \\cdot 437 + 3 \\cdot 234 + 4x = 2024\n$$\nSubstitute $a_1 = 229 - x$:\n$$\n(229 - x) + 874 + 702 + 4x = 2024\n\\Rightarrow 229 - x + 1576 + 4x = 2024\n\\Rightarrow 1805 + 3x = 2024\n\\Rightarrow 3x = 219 \\Rightarrow x = 73.\n$$\n\n\\boxed{73}",
