    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Let’s break it down step-by-step.\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Understanding the problem**  \nWe have an \\(8\\times 8\\) grid, so paths start at the bottom-left \\((0,0)\\) and end at the top-right \\((8,8)\\).  \nA *step* means moving either right or up along grid lines.  \nA *change of direction* means switching from right to up or up to right.\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Characterizing “changes direction exactly four times”**  \nIf a path changes direction exactly four times, then the path has **5 segments** (alternating horizontal and vertical runs).  \nExamples in the problem show either:\n- Start horizontal, then vertical, horizontal, vertical, horizontal.  \nOr  \n- Start vertical, then horizontal, vertical, horizontal, vertical.\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Structure of segments**  \nLet’s handle Type A: Start horizontal, then vertical, etc. → pattern: H–V–H–V–H.  \nSo there are 3 horizontal segments and 2 vertical segments.  \nEach segment length \\(\\ge 1\\).  \n\nLet lengths be \\(a_1, b_1, a_2, b_2, a_3\\) with \\(a_i\\) horizontal lengths, \\(b_j\\) vertical lengths.  \nWe have:\n\\[\na_1 + a_2 + a_3 = 8,\\quad a_i \\ge 1,\n\\]\n\\[\nb_1 + b_2 = 8,\\quad b_j \\ge 1.\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Counting Type A**  \nNumber of solutions to \\(a_1 + a_2 + a_3 = 8\\) with \\(a_i \\ge 1\\) is \\(\\binom{8-1}{3-1} = \\binom{7}{2} = 21\\).  \nNumber of solutions to \\(b_1 + b_2 = 8\\) with \\(b_j \\ge 1\\) is \\(\\binom{8-1}{2-1} = \\binom{7}{1} = 7\\).  \nMultiply: \\(21 \\times 7 = 147\\) for Type A.\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Type B: Start vertical**  \nPattern V–H–V–H–V:  \n2 horizontal segments (\\(c_1 + c_2 = 8, c_j \\ge 1\\)),  \n3 vertical segments (\\(d_1 + d_2 + d_3 = 8, d_i \\ge 1\\)).  \n\nNumber of solutions:  \n\\(c_1 + c_2 = 8\\), \\(c_j \\ge 1\\) → \\(\\binom{7}{1} = 7\\).  \n\\(d_1 + d_2 + d_3 = 8\\), \\(d_i \\ge 1\\) → \\(\\binom{7}{2} = 21\\).  \nMultiply: \\(7 \\times 21 = 147\\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 6: Total paths**  \nTotal = Type A + Type B = \\(147 + 147 = 294\\).\n\n---\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{294}\n\\]",
