=990 divisible by 11 ⇒ k=0 even.  \nn=994: k=1 even.  \nn=995: k=2 odd.  \nn=996: k=3 even.  \nn=997: k=4 odd.  \nn=998: k=5 odd.  \nn=999: k=6 odd.  \nn=1000: k=7 odd.  \n\nSo remaining 8 terms: evens at n=993, 994, 996 ⇒ 3 evens.  \n\nTotal evens: 360 + 3 = 363 from n=3..1000.  \n\nWe also need to check n=1 and n=2: both odd ⇒ not counted.  \n\nSo total $a_n = a_{n+1}$ for n ≤ 1000 is 363.  \n\n---\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{363}\n\\]",
